{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGER ZERO</strong> is an action-roguelike with political simulator elements. You play as a mercenary with the code name\u00a0<i>&quot;Viper&quot;</i>, doing jobs for powerful factions with varying ideologies and beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The missions you undertake, the relationships you build, and your choices will determine the fate of the star system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A MERCENARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy onto <strong>a variety of procedurally generated planets</strong> to complete missions for clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.poster.avif?t=1757924357\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.webm?t=1757924357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.mp4?t=1757924357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCESSIBLE MECH BUILDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own mech using hundreds of unique parts. Mech building is simple and doesn't require analyzing spreadsheets of information and stats. <strong>Any build is viable, and there are literally millions of possible combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.poster.avif?t=1757924357\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.webm?t=1757924357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.mp4?t=1757924357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CONFLICT OF GALACTIC SCALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days pass with each mission you complete. Over time, the number of pilots in the star system will <strong>dynamically fight each other based on their alignments, relationships, and more</strong>. <u><strong>The war will end, and time will progress with or without you.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you step in and try to bring peace to the warring factions? Do you stay neutral and let it play out? Or do you bide your time, wait, and strike when the enemy is weak?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BLEND OF LO-FI AND HEAVY METAL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack mixes together different genres of music. There is calm, lo-fi music during down time, which ramps up and explodes into heavy metal during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND THE TRUTH, SAVE THE WORLD.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction has their own agenda, their own views on the world and how it should be run. Depending on who you side with, a variety of different endings can be achieved. You can save the world, stopping the forces that threaten the balance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... Or you can take it for yourself.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3168670?t=1757924357","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757924357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/12ff078ce8f1d7dff26939f562820f8aab335776/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757924357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/12ff078ce8f1d7dff26939f562820f8aab335776/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757924357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"SCAVENGER ZERO depicts characters using drugs and alcohol. Some characters talk about criminal acts in a positive light, and heavy language is used. Themes of depression and suicide are mentioned; but never explicitly shown."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGER ZERO</strong> is an action-roguelike with political simulator elements. You play as a mercenary with the code name\u00a0<i>&quot;Viper&quot;</i>, doing jobs for powerful factions with varying ideologies and beliefs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The missions you undertake, the relationships you build, and your choices will determine the fate of the star system.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A MERCENARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy onto <strong>a variety of procedurally generated planets</strong> to complete missions for clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.poster.avif?t=1757924357\" width=800 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.webm?t=1757924357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/6ea2e9755653617fe4a0d9532d175a99.mp4?t=1757924357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ACCESSIBLE MECH BUILDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own mech using hundreds of unique parts. Mech building is simple and doesn't require analyzing spreadsheets of information and stats. <strong>Any build is viable, and there are literally millions of possible combinations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.poster.avif?t=1757924357\" width=800 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.webm?t=1757924357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/extras/be532c81565c45a0166477a45e6add51.mp4?t=1757924357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CONFLICT OF GALACTIC SCALE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days pass with each mission you complete. Over time, the number of pilots in the star system will <strong>dynamically fight each other based on their alignments, relationships, and more</strong>. <u><strong>The war will end, and time will progress with or without you.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you step in and try to bring peace to the warring factions? Do you stay neutral and let it play out? Or do you bide your time, wait, and strike when the enemy is weak?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A BLEND OF LO-FI AND HEAVY METAL.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack mixes together different genres of music. There is calm, lo-fi music during down time, which ramps up and explodes into heavy metal during combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIND THE TRUTH, SAVE THE WORLD.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction has their own agenda, their own views on the world and how it should be run. Depending on who you side with, a variety of different endings can be achieved. You can save the world, stopping the forces that threaten the balance...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... Or you can take it for yourself.</i></p>","developers":["Keenan Dignam"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3168670/header.jpg?t=1757924357","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"SCAVENGER ZERO \u00a9 2024 - 2025 Keenan \"Keenan_Dev\" Dignam, All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"SCAVENGER ZERO","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 460 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 460 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Keenan Dignam"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drogas il\u00edcitas\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria\nViol\u00eancia","rating":"18","rati